{
  "name": "run-cold-context",
  "mode": "tool",
  "description": "The cold-context evaluator run-cold-context.mjs and its Jet twin RunColdContext.jet (#5072 c9): each case runs the whole matrix of adapters, contexts and tasks against stand-ins, and the check prints stdout, then the scoreboard and baseline the run wrote. fake-model.sh answers each family, context and task with a candidate whose markers make fake-jet.sh (the --jet-bin) pass, fail to check, print, write stderr, exit nonzero, or serve HTTP through serve.mjs, so the rows cover every outcome, an integral and a fractional pass rate, a JSON-wrapped and a fenced answer, and model output with no entry point. The other cases cover help, every usage error (exit 64), a blocked preflight, adapter failure, an unset or unreachable API (78), and a baseline that is blocked, has another capsule, or meets a control-only run (1). The adapter environment names are FIXTURE_* so the machine leaks into nothing. The harness descriptor names the program that ran, and artifact paths are relative to the repository, so the check prints them as <harness> and as file names.",
  "tool": {
    "original": "Tools/agent-eval/run-cold-context.mjs",
    "jet": "Tools/agent-eval/RunColdContext.jet",
    "fixtures": "fixtures",
    "cases": [
      {"args": ["--help"], "env": {"JET_AGENT_EVAL_SCRATCH_DIR": "cases", "JET_AGENT_EVAL_ADAPTER_SCRATCH_DIR": "adapters", "FIXTURE_ANTHROPIC_COMMAND": "[\"sh\",\"../../fake-model.sh\",\"anthropic\"]"}, "exit": 0, "check": "check.jet", "expected": "expected/help.out"},
